    "Name": "Big Brother",
    "Details": "The Big Brother BB-1X mounts two heavy rifles - one in each arm - alongside a machine gun in each side torso to match its Little Brother companion. Seven tons of primitive armor cover the frame, and an IndustrialMech ejection seat gives the pilot an escape option if things go wrong.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.77</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
